WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Design preview gives you ultimate control over your case.

00:01.000 --> 00:11.000
With margin lines you can see exactly where those margin lines are, so you and your lab technician are on the exact same page.

00:11.000 --> 00:21.000
You can review the aesthetics of your long-span bridges or anterior cases to make sure every shape, contour, embrasure is just the way you like.

00:21.000 --> 00:27.000
You're able to analyze heatmaps to see occlusion, contacts, and material thickness.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
You can change the transparency on your restorations to see right through to your preps.

00:32.000 --> 00:41.000
And if you see anything you don't like, you can add a rejection note, tell your technician exactly what you want to change,

00:41.000 --> 00:46.000
and even point them directly to it with our annotation tools.

00:46.000 --> 00:52.000
You can compare versions to see before and after your design rejections.

00:52.000 --> 00:56.000
And when you feel good, you just approve that design and we'll bring it right to fabrication.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
Design previews are available for dentures.

01:00.000 --> 01:06.000
They're also available for implants. And they're always free.

01:06.000 --> 01:17.000
Design previews help you make every case more predictable, you'll eliminate remakes, no surprises, you'll have more control and visibility.
